Note:                                                             9040 1451  123
Although the uncertainties are quoted as total, a 1% systematic   9040 1451  124
uncertainty was acknowledged by Abfalterer in a publication.      9040 1451  125
By analogy, the same is adopted for all measurements. In addition,9040 1451  126
a 0.2% fully correlated uncertainty was assumed between all       9040 1451  127
measurements.                                                     9040 1451  128
                                                                  9040 1451  129
A 2% uncertainty was added from 1E-5 eV to 897 KeV to the elastic 9040 1451  130
cross section to account for the scattering radius uncertainty    9040 1451  131
The final covariance matrix was converted into ENDF format with   9040 1451  132
the ENDCOV code (A.Trkov).                                        9040 1451  133
