EVALUATION OF THE AVERAGE RESONANCE PARAMETERS IN THE UNRESOLVED  9040 1451  525
RESONANCE REGION FROM 4 TO 100 keV                                9040 1451  526
                                                                  9040 1451  527
A) ENDF-6 EVALUATED FILE FROM 4 to 100 KEV (MF=2,3,4)             9040 1451  528
   I. Sirakov and P. Schillebeeckx (INRNE,IRMM), Geel, Dec 2005   9040 1451  529
   R. Capote Noy and A. Trkov (IAEA)                              9040 1451  530
